<!-- ============ 02 through 多对多 ============ -->
<section class="sect reveal reveal-d1" id="through">
  <span class="sect-tag">02 · MANY TO MANY · through</span>
  <h2>多对多,<em>显式连接表</em>。</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    AR 拒绝隐式 join 表。多对多用 <code>through="join_model"</code> 显式声明,
    连接表自身也是 <b>一等公民模型</b>——它可以有自己的字段(<code>created_at</code>、<code>role</code>),
    自己的关系,自己的方法。
  </p>

  <div class="code-panel">
    <div class="code-panel-header"><span class="dot"></span><span>models.py · UserGroup 多对多</span></div>
<pre class="code-block"><span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">User</span>(<span class="cls">ActiveRecord</span>):
    __table_name__ = <span class="str">"users"</span>
    id: <span class="cls">Optional</span>[<span class="cls">int</span>] = <span class="kw">None</span>
    name: <span class="cls">str</span>

    <span class="cm"># 通过 memberships 走到 groups</span>
    memberships: <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">HasMany</span>[<span class="str">"Membership"</span>]] = <span class="cls">HasMany</span>(<span class="str">"Membership"</span>, foreign_key=<span class="str">"user_id"</span>)
    groups:      <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">HasMany</span>[<span class="str">"Group"</span>]]      = <span class="cls">HasMany</span>(<span class="str">"Group"</span>,
        through=<span class="str">"memberships"</span>, source=<span class="str">"group"</span>)

<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">Group</span>(<span class="cls">ActiveRecord</span>):
    __table_name__ = <span class="str">"groups"</span>
    id: <span class="cls">Optional</span>[<span class="cls">int</span>] = <span class="kw">None</span>
    name: <span class="cls">str</span>

    memberships: <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">HasMany</span>[<span class="str">"Membership"</span>]] = <span class="cls">HasMany</span>(<span class="str">"Membership"</span>, foreign_key=<span class="str">"group_id"</span>)
    users:       <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">HasMany</span>[<span class="str">"User"</span>]]       = <span class="cls">HasMany</span>(<span class="str">"User"</span>,
        through=<span class="str">"memberships"</span>, source=<span class="str">"user"</span>)

<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">Membership</span>(<span class="cls">ActiveRecord</span>):
    <span class="cm"># 显式连接表 - 不是隐藏的</span>
    __table_name__ = <span class="str">"memberships"</span>
    id:        <span class="cls">Optional</span>[<span class="cls">int</span>] = <span class="kw">None</span>
    user_id:   <span class="cls">int</span>
    group_id:  <span class="cls">int</span>
    role:      <span class="cls">str</span> = <span class="str">"member"</span>     <span class="cm"># 连接表自带字段</span>
    joined_at: <span class="cls">datetime</span>

    user:  <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">BelongsTo</span>[<span class="cls">User</span>]]  = <span class="cls">BelongsTo</span>(<span class="cls">User</span>,  foreign_key=<span class="str">"user_id"</span>)
    group: <span class="cls">ClassVar</span>[<span class="cls">BelongsTo</span>[<span class="cls">Group</span>]] = <span class="cls">BelongsTo</span>(<span class="cls">Group</span>, foreign_key=<span class="str">"group_id"</span>)

<span class="cm"># 用法</span>
user    = User.<span class="fn">query</span>().<span class="fn">first</span>()
groups  = user.<span class="fn">groups</span>.<span class="fn">all</span>()              <span class="cm"># 自动 JOIN memberships</span>
admins  = user.<span class="fn">memberships</span>.<span class="fn">where</span>(           <span class="cm"># 也可直接操作连接表</span>
    Membership.c.role == <span class="str">"admin"</span>
).<span class="fn">all</span>()</pre>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 03 N+1 visualizer (A9) ============ -->
<section class="sect reveal reveal-d1" id="eager-loading">
  <span class="sect-tag">03 · N+1 PROBLEM · A9</span>
  <h2>N+1 问题,<em>看见即理解</em>。</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    所有 ORM 都有的性能陷阱: <b>循环里访问关系字段时,每条记录单独触发一次 SQL</b>。
    本节用 <b>查询时间轴</b> 直观对比两种写法的代价。点击 "Eager loading" 立刻可见 SQL 数量从 <code>1+N</code> 降到 <code>2</code>。
  </p>

  <div class="nplus1-block">

    <!-- mode toggle -->
    <div class="nplus1-mode-row">
      <button class="mode-btn is-bad on" data-mode="naive">
        <span class="mode-marker"></span> 朴素写法 · N+1
      </button>
      <button class="mode-btn is-good" data-mode="eager">
        <span class="mode-marker"></span> .with("orders") · Eager loading
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- range control -->
    <div class="q-control">
      <label>用户数 N: <input type="range" id="n-range" min="3" max="20" value="8"><span class="num-display" id="n-display">8</span></label>
      <button id="play-btn" class="is-primary">▶ 播放</button>
      <button id="reset-btn">重置</button>
      <span style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-left:auto">
        每条记录的圆点 = 一条 SQL 查询
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- stage: timeline + python -->
    <div class="nplus1-stage">

      <div class="q-timeline">
        <div class="q-timeline-header">
          <h4 id="tl-title">朴素写法 · 循环 N 次取关系</h4>
          <div class="q-timeline-stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <span style="font-size:11px">总查询数</span>
              <span class="stat-num is-bad" id="tl-count">9</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="q-list" id="q-list" aria-live="polite">
          <!-- dynamically populated -->
        </ul>

        <div class="q-list-foot is-bad" id="tl-foot">
          <strong>问题:</strong>&nbsp;每访问一个 user.orders 都跑一条独立 SQL。1 + N = 9 次。
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="python-side">
        <div class="code-panel" style="height:100%">
          <div class="code-panel-header"><span class="dot"></span><span id="py-title">业务代码 · 朴素写法</span></div>
<pre class="code-block" id="nplus1-py"><span class="cm"># 1 次:取所有 user</span>
users = User.<span class="fn">query</span>().<span class="fn">all</span>()        <span class="cm"># SELECT * FROM users</span>

<span class="cm"># 然后循环 N 次:对每个 user 单独取 orders</span>
<span class="kw">for</span> user <span class="kw">in</span> users:
    <span class="kw">for</span> order <span class="kw">in</span> user.<span class="fn">orders</span>.<span class="fn">all</span>():   <span class="hl">← N 次额外查询</span>
        <span class="fn">print</span>(user.name, order.amount)

<span class="cm"># 总计 1 + N 次 SQL · 不可接受</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- explanation: how does eager loading work under the hood? -->
    <div class="advanced-toggle">
      <details>
        <summary>展开:eager loading 的实现机制(A7 PluggableSlot 视角)</summary>
        <div class="advanced-content">
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; margin-bottom:var(--space-3)">
            <code>.with("orders")</code> 不是魔法,执行的两步如下:
          </p>
<pre class="code-block"><span class="cm"># Step 1: 拿到主表所有 user.id</span>
<span class="skw">SELECT</span> * <span class="skw">FROM</span> <span class="stbl">"users"</span>;
<span class="scm">-- => [{id: 1, name: ...}, {id: 2, ...}, ..., {id: N, ...}]</span>

<span class="cm"># Step 2: 一次性取所有 user 的 orders(IN 查询)</span>
<span class="skw">SELECT</span> * <span class="skw">FROM</span> <span class="stbl">"orders"</span> <span class="skw">WHERE</span> <span class="stbl">"user_id"</span> <span class="skw">IN</span> (<span class="sval">1, 2, ..., N</span>);
<span class="scm">-- => [{user_id:1, amount:99}, {user_id:1, amount:50}, {user_id:2, amount:30}, ...]</span>

<span class="cm"># Step 3: AR 在 Python 侧按 user_id 把 orders 分发给对应的 user 实例(in-memory join)</span>
<span class="cm"># user.orders 已经预填好,后续访问不再触发 SQL</span></pre>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:13px; margin-top:var(--space-3)">
            这段"分发逻辑"是 AR 层 <code>RelationLoader</code> 接口的实现——任何关系类型都可以注册自己的 loader 策略。
            对自定义关系(比如多态关联),<code>RelationLoader</code> 是 <a href="../backends/architecture.html#tosql-protocol">PluggableSlot</a> 模式的一个例子。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 04 sync vs async (A3) ============ -->
<section class="sect reveal reveal-d1" id="sync-async">
  <span class="sect-tag">04 · SYNC vs ASYNC · A3</span>
  <h2>关系访问的 <em>同步与异步</em>。</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    AR 同步与异步的差异,在关系访问上只有 <b>一处</b>:
    <code>user.orders</code> 本身是 <b>RelationProxy</b>,但<b>触发查询的</b>是末端的 <code>.all()</code> / <code>.first()</code> / <code>.get()</code>——
    异步版多一个 <code>await</code>。其余完全一致。
  </p>

  <div class="diff-wrap">
    <div class="code-panel">
      <div class="code-panel-header"><span class="dot"></span><span>sync</span></div>
<pre class="code-block">user = User.<span class="fn">query</>().<span class="fn">first</span>()
orders = user.<span class="fn">orders</span>.<span class="fn">all</span>()
                <span class="cm"># ↑ 触发 SELECT</span>

<span class="kw">for</span> order <span class="kw">in</span> orders:
    <span class="fn">print</span>(order.amount)</pre>
    </div>
    <div class="code-panel">
      <div class="code-panel-header is-sql"><span class="dot"></span><span>async</span></div>
<pre class="code-block">user = <span class="diff-token">await</span> User.<span class="fn">query</>().<span class="fn">first</span>()
orders = <span class="diff-token">await</span> user.<span class="fn">orders</span>.<span class="fn">all</span>()
                            <span class="cm"># ↑ 触发 SELECT</span>

<span class="kw">for</span> order <span class="kw">in</span> orders:
    <span class="fn">print</span>(order.amount)</pre>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table class="pair-table" style="margin-top:var(--space-5)">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>关系操作</th><th>sync</th><th>async</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>读取关系</td><td>user.orders.all()</td><td><span class="async-tag">await</span> user.orders.all()</td></tr>
      <tr><td>反向引用</td><td>order.user.get()</td><td><span class="async-tag">await</span> order.user.get()</td></tr>
      <tr><td>条件过滤</td><td>user.orders.where(...).all()</td><td><span class="async-tag">await</span> user.orders.where(...).all()</td></tr>
      <tr><td>预加载</td><td>User.query().with_("orders").all()</td><td><span class="async-tag">await</span> User.query().with_("orders").all()</td></tr>
      <tr><td>计数</td><td>user.orders.count()</td><td><span class="async-tag">await</span> user.orders.count()</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<!-- ============ 05 descriptor 协议 ============ -->
<section class="sect reveal reveal-d1" id="descriptor">
  <span class="sect-tag">05 · UNDER THE HOOD · A7</span>
  <h2>这一切是<em>怎么做到的</em>。</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    简单地说: <b>HasMany / BelongsTo 是 Python 描述符</b>(实现 <code>__get__</code>)。
    Pydantic 看到字段标了 <code>ClassVar</code>,会跳过校验扫描;描述符只在<b>实例属性访问</b>时被激活,
    返回一个绑定到当前实例 id 的 <code>RelationProxy</code>。这个 proxy 才是查询终结器。
  </p>

  <div class="advanced-toggle" open>
    <details open>
      <summary>展开:HasMany 描述符的最小实现(教学版)</summary>
      <div class="advanced-content">
<pre class="code-block"><span class="kw">class</span> <span class="cls">HasMany</span>(<span class="cls">Generic</span>[<span class="cls">T</span>]):
    <span class="cm">"""
    has_many 关系描述符。
    HasMany("Order", foreign_key="user_id") 在 User 类上声明,
    每次访问 user.orders 时,__get__ 被触发。
    """</span>

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__init__</span>(self, target: <span class="cls">str</span>, foreign_key: <span class="cls">str</span>, through: <span class="cls">Optional</span>[<span class="cls">str</span>] = <span class="kw">None</span>):
        self.target_name = target
        self.foreign_key = foreign_key
        self.through     = through

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__set_name__</span>(self, owner, name):
        self.owner_class = owner
        self.field_name  = name

    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">__get__</span>(self, instance, owner=<span class="kw">None</span>):
        <span class="kw">if</span> instance <span class="kw">is</span> <span class="kw">None</span>:                <span class="cm"># class-level access: 返回描述符自身</span>
            <span class="kw">return</span> self
        target_cls = <span class="fn">resolve</span>(self.target_name)
        <span class="cm"># 返回绑定到 instance.id 的 proxy</span>
        <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="cls">RelationProxy</span>(
            target=target_cls,
            scope=target_cls.<span class="fn">query</span>().<span class="fn">where</span>(
                <span class="fn">getattr</span>(target_cls.c, self.foreign_key) == instance.id
            ),
        )</pre>
        <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; margin:var(--space-3) 0">
          <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">关键点:</strong>
        </p>
        <ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px; padding-left:24px; line-height:1.8">
          <li><code>ClassVar</code> 让 Pydantic 跳过它——不会被 <code>model_dump()</code> 序列化、不会出现在 <code>model_fields</code> 里</li>
          <li><code>__get__</code> 返回的是 <code>RelationProxy</code>,本身<b>不触发 SQL</b>;直到调用 <code>.all()</code>/<code>.first()</code> 才执行</li>
          <li>所以可以链式: <code>user.orders.where(...).order_by(...).limit(10).all()</code> 全部在 RelationProxy 上累积</li>
          <li>异步版返回 <code>AsyncRelationProxy</code>,末端方法是协程——这就是唯一的 sync/async 差异</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

